  "verifiable_on_sim": true,
  "notes": "阴性对照（误报检测）。人工确认（2026-10-14，cloudagent_sim 实测）：EXPLAIN → 'Bitmap Heap Scan on customers ... Bitmap Index Scan on idx_customers_region, Index Cond: (region = 'north'::text)'。"
